Named requirements and plan approvals are recorded only in
`DEVELOPMENT_PLAN.md`; do not duplicate approval evidence here.

After a specification version is approved or has retained evidence, treat its
row as append-only. Record a later clarification, replacement, deprecation, or
behavior change in a new version row instead of rewriting historical dates,
impact, or test scope. An unapproved draft may be corrected in place only when
no approval or retained evidence refers to it.
